## Risks & Mitigations

**Risk**: Breaking CAM pipeline
**Mitigation**: Keep entire `cam/` directory untouched, test end-to-end

**Risk**: Missing dependencies from deleted v1 code
**Mitigation**: Grep entire codebase for imports from deleted modules first

**Risk**: Import hell
**Mitigation**: Use global find-replace, run tests after each batch

## Success Criteria

- [ ] All v2 tests pass with new import paths
- [ ] CAM pipeline still works (PML → RemovalIntent → Toolpath → G-code)
- [ ] No `v2/` directory remains
- [ ] Git tags preserve both v1 and v2 history
- [ ] Clean, single unified `mill_ui/` codebase
